WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.190
<b>September 1st</b>

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.570
<b>Student Monitor</b>

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.900
Show me what's in that bag!

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.730
Th-This is my homework for summer break.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.940
Th-There's nothing suspicious about it.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.030
Then show me.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.410
You think you can escape?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.040
Let go!

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.890
Let me go!

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.790
<i>Everyone has</i>

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.980
<i>a secret they can't tell anyone else.</i>

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.960
Stand.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.020
Bow.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.290
<i>I am the quiet, bespectacled 
class representative.</i>

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:49.440
<i>And even I, Shimomura Masako, 
the so-called serious girl,</i>

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.120
<i>have a secret.</i>

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.310
Wait.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.370
You dropped something.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.050
Huh?

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.030
What is this?

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:00.530
Cat ears?

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.660
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:04.970
<i>This isn't good! This isn't good!</i>

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.500
<i>People will discover I'm a cosplayer!</i>

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>If people find out I love anime 
and make anime cosplay...</i>

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.500
<i>She pretends to be serious, 
but she's a cosplay freak!</i>

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:20.270
<i>I'm proud of the Sone Miko-tan 
cat ear headband I made,</i>

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:23.170
<i>but this what I get for bringing it to school!</i>

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.060
<i>I lasted this long without 
anyone discovering my secret!</i>

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.600
<i>Stupid, stupid! I'm so stupid!</i>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.690
Th-That's not mine!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.440
I'm sure it's yours.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.070
What do you use it for?

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.810
<i>It's Rurumo-san, the girl who dresses like a witch!</i>

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:41.780
<i>I'm so glad she was the one who picked it up.</i>

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.000
You and I truly are comrades!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.680
A Secret I Can't Tell Anyone

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.140
Sorry to drag you here without warning.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:29.830
You asked me before to hang out with you.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:30.640
Now is the perfect time.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.350
Oh, good.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.380
I'm so glad!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.070
After all, cosplayers are always alone.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.320
They shop for fabric alone, 
make outfits alone,

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.410
and try on their cosplays alone.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.530
Sure, I'm happy when I finish an outfit,

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:48.490
and it's the best feeling ever when 
I pose in front of the mirror, but...

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.950
You get it, right?

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.000
Who are you?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.540
From that moment, you become 
whatever character you like!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.140
From Miren and Guren to Sone Miko 
and her rival Kagami Mary,

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.760
you can become anyone.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.120
Even someone like myself 
who's not very athletic

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.510
can make big plays as the 
protagonist of a sports series,

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.410
or feel as if I'm flying through 
the air like a super hero!

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:15.400
It's like magic.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.180
Huh?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.730
The ability to become someone else.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.400
It's like magic.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:23.900
Yeah!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.280
Yeah! I always knew it would be even more fun

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:32.160
if I had a friend to make outfits with,
 and to talk and go places with!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.270
I'm Shimomura Masako.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:36.540
Call me Masako.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:38.670
Okay.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.960
I feel my courage rising.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.310
Let's do our best at the event, Ruru-chan!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.270
Event?

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:44.930
Yeah!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.130
I've been looking for someone 
to go to the event with me.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.990
I'm so glad you said you'd go!

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.950
<b>Shibaki</b>

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:55.980
I'm back.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.010
You're late. Where have you been?

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.400
We were worried about ya.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.030
What's that?

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:06.060
I am studying something called "cosplay."

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.500
What? Cosplay?

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.160
<b>Magical Voice Sone Miko</b>

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.670
What's all this?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.460
She told me to study, so I borrowed these.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.190
Anime DVDs?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.870
<i>Sone Miko</i> used to be on late at night...

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:22.580
It's about a girl called Sone Miko who goes

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.200
on a journey to recover her 
lost singing voice, apparently.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.600
I see...

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:37.380
<i>I want to tie great magic 
together with a starry strap.</i>

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:44.070
<b>Magical Voice 
Sone Miko</b>

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:50.580
<i>My red mic cord is connected to you.</i>

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:57.610
<i>My voice should carry my feelings
to their destination.</i>

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:04.230
<i>Seal away this shine within 
a disc before it overflows.</i>

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.270
You know,

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:04.210
I like the way Miko-tan keeps trying, 
even when she's put down or bullied.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:11.290
<i>I feel like I can reach the 
shooting stars so high in the sky.</i>

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.710
And when Miko-tan loses her hat,

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:14.600
her crush gently gives her this 
cat ear headband to replace it.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.970
Did you make that, too?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.150
Honestly, I'm pretty proud of this.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.210
I focused on the details

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.550
and found fabrics as close to 
the colors in the show as possible.

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:23.760
I even paid attention to the texture

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.300
and used different amounts of 
cotton in different places.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.740
I wouldn't be ashamed to 
show this gem anywhere.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.400
<i>Did I freak her out?</i>

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:38.000
So it's full of your love for cosplay.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:44.180
<i>With the power of courage 
hidden in my heart, I can fly!</i>

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.400
Yeah.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:50.660
<i>Someday I'll wrap you up in my song.</i>

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.180
This is a good song.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.000
I really love it!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.880
What's this flyer?

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.890
<b>Magical Voice Sone Miko</b>

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.810
"Cosplay Festival 552"? What's that?

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:11.500
It's an upcoming cosplay event 
specifically for <i>Sone Miko,</i> apparently.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.150
What's a cosplay event?

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:22.190
<b>Now accepting event participants!</b>

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:22.620
<b>Comic Festival 552</b>

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:22.620
<b>Sone Miko event 
to be held!</b>

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.230
I don't know the details.

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:19.500
Before I knew it, it was 
decided that I'd participate,

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.940
so I'm going.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:21.810
How'd that happen?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.380
Well, it sounds fun to me!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.630
Meeting up at a friend's house to get ready... 
It's kinda like a cultural festival.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.120
Friend...

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:34.740
She's incredibly knowledgeable about cosplay,

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.250
and she's skilled at making costumes.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:40.220
She's not so much a friend as a teacher, I think.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.950
Really?

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:44.010
Is she that much older than you?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:46.400
No. She's your age.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.990
Who is it?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.200
The student monitor Shimomura Masako.

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:55.950
See you later!

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.620
I can fly!

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:05.540
Huh?

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.750
Hey, I heard you cosplay, Shimomura.

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:10.860
Seriously?

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.080
That's surprising.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.900
Where do they sell those clothes?

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:16.600
You make your own costumes, right?

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:17.830
What are they talking about?

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.050
Apparently Shimomura-san cosplays.

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.130
What? Really?

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:24.700
<i>Ruru-chan told them. 
It's the only explanation.</i>

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.470
<i>Ruru-chan...</i>

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.400
No.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:33.940
<i>I thought we were friends.</i>

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.280
<i>We're not friends anymore!</i>

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.320
Shimomura?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.290
<i>I'm stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.200
<i>I was so happy, I got delusional!</i>

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.410
<i>It's just like that time!</i>

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:51.460
<i>I want to be a designer, 
so I'm not really into anime.</i>

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.850
<i>I've had enough. 
I'll never trust anyone again.</i>

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.810
Hello, is this the cosplay festival office?

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:06.270
I'm Shimomura, entry number A96.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.640
Um, I'd like to cancel my participation 
in this weekend's event.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.980
I won't be appearing.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:13.660
<i>I'll...</i>

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:19.200
<i>I'll never talk about cosplay 
in front of anyone again.</i>

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.160
Masako?

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.290
Ruru... R-Ruru... R-R-Ruru...

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.260
What's wrong, Masako?

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.660
Are you all right?

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.720
You dropped this again.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.000
Sone Miko panties.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.350
Why are you so...

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.600
This is important to you, right?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.970
It appeared in episode 18, if I recall.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.780
You watched it?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.180
It took three days to watch all of it.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.240
I need sleep.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.330
<i>She already watched all of it?</i>

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.700
Wh-What did you think?

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:09.250
As a whole, I had trouble understanding it.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.460
But episode 18 was the most interesting.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.690
You can have it.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.220
I couldn't accept something 
so important to you.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.350
I made it for you.

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:27.890
I was happy

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.330
because we became friends.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.360
All right.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:44.080
Are you sure it was okay to skip the event?

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.420
I don't think I could've done it, after all.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.410
I don't have any confidence.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.910
You're plenty cute, Masako.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.040
Th-Thank you.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.380
Here we go, Ruru-chan!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:03.550
<i>Someday I'll wrap you up in my song.</i>

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.080
This is great!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.740
So this is what they call a memento.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:10.260
Yeah! Let's keep making more!

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.540
Huh?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.940
<b>Robot anime 
<i>Port Earth</i>
 13 Volumes Total</b>

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.940
<b>Slice of Life anime 
<i>A Day in the Life 
of the Minamida Family</i>
 26 Volumes Total</b>

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.900
So next is <i>Port Earth</i>...

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:27.040
<b>Robot Anime Port Earth</b>

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.040
The path of cosplay sure is steep.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.040
<b>Teacher</b>

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.880
My chest cover broke.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:46.260
<i>Well, I've been using it for 170 years.</i>

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:52.510
<i>My chest feels drafty without it.</i>

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.810
Rurumo, get this off me!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:59.940
That jerk Chiro did this to me while I was napping!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.360
A simple task. Sit.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.080
<i>Why do I feel embarrassed?</i>

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.930
<i>My pajamas are fluttering against me...</i>

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.280
<i>What is this sense of defenselessness?</i>

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.240
<i>Close... So close...</i>

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:23.610
<i>He's so close to my chest...</i>

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.500
<i>He can't see, can he?</i>

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.160
<i>He can't tell, can he?</i>

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.190
<i>He hasn't noticed, has he?</i>

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.930
<i>That my chest cover is missing...</i>

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:39.180
What's wrong? Your face is red.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:41.690
I-I'm okay.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.200
You don't look okay to me.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.500
I'm fine.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.070
But...

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.950
I can't do this anymore.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:52.300
H-Hey, you don't look so good.
Do you have a cold?

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.410
No, I'm fine.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:55.560
I'm fine...

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:56.770
I'm fine...

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.170
I'm fine...

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.460
If there's anything you want, let me know!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.760
I'll go buy you some water 
or juice or whatever!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.430
<i>I must do something quickly.</i>

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.820
<i>I'm</i> not okay!

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:13.120
What am I gonna do about this?!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.810
<i>What's wrong with Rurumo?</i>

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.600
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.480
I see. A new chest cover, eh?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:25.340
It'll take some time to have one 
sent from the spirit world.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:27.700
I see.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:31.620
It's huge!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:35.720
I thought one of Mama-san's would do for now,

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.930
but this is too big for ya.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.150
For me?

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.960
Yeah, it won't fit ya.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.800
I never noticed 'cause she's 
always wearin' an apron,

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:49.680
<b>Oh,
 my!</b>

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:49.680
<b>They're
 not 
<i>that</i> 
big.</b>

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:48.490
but Mama-san's got some big boobs.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.680
"Big boobs"?

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.040
Yeah, she's an E.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.640
<b>Big Boobs?</b>

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.210
E?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.640
<b>E?</b>

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:54.640
Her bra size.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:55.770
Bra?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.340
Her chest cover.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.470
They call 'em bras down here.

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:02.160
Unlike chest covers, they come in all sizes,

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.650
and they're sized in the order of the alphabet.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:10.480
What should we do? Ya can't use any of these.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.740
I'll figure something out at school.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.950
What? A chest cover?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:16.840
Yes.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:20.160
I asked my familiar Chiro to get me 
one from the spirit world,

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.420
but it will take some time.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.960
In the meantime, I would like 
to acquire an Earth chest cover.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.880
<i>Ruru-chan's amazing. 
She's living her cosplay.</i>

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.020
<i>Even her story is perfect.</i>

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.500
<i>She's a model cosplayer. 
A full-time cosplayer!</i>

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:34.720
What's wrong?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:36.940
Very well.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.610
You want a new bra, yes?

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.240
Yes, that.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.180
You're good at making costumes.

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.400
You can make one, right?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:49.110
Oh, that's not quite the same as cosplay...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.840
There are things even you can't make?

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.430
I'm sorry. But leave it to me!

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:56.200
I'll ask someone who might know more.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.470
What? It's not that big of a deal.

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:00.140
No, I'll figure something out.

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.830
After all, my friend's in trouble.

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:01.830
Good grief...

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:04.670
No Running in the Hallway!
- Student Monitors

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.400
With frills.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.310
<i>This is getting out of hand...</i>

